OL,3,GNEWSASinger Toyah Willcox awarded
OL,4,Ahonorary doctorate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger-songwriter Toyah Willcox has
OL,7,Fbeen awarded an honorary doctorate by
OL,8,Fthe University of Worcester.
OL,10,FDuring a career spanning more than four
OL,11,Fdecades, Willcox recorded 25 albums,
OL,12,Fachieved 13 Top 40 singles, appeared in
OL,13,Fmore than 20 feature films and over 40
OL,14,Fstage productions.
OL,16,FAlongside her artistic achievements,
OL,17,Fshe has been a patron of the Avon
OL,18,FNavigation Trust since 2024, supporting
OL,19,Fenvironmental education and youth
OL,20,Fprogrammes.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
