OL,3,GNEWSASinger Toyah Willcox awarded
OL,4,Ahonorary doctorate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at the ceremony at Worcester
OL,7,FCathedral on Tuesday, she said: "I'm so
OL,8,Fproud and it's such an honour to be
OL,9,Fasked by Worcester University because I
OL,10,Flive within this area."
